UID:4fe08311-b412-5c4b-815a-5f51c6b05571@canyonlands2026
DTSTAMP:20260922T203638Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20261004T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20261004T101500
SUMMARY:DRESS REHEARSAL — Doudy Draw loop ×2\, opposite rotations (20 mi
 )
DESCRIPTION:Marshall Mesa / Doudy Draw loop x2 from Doudy Draw TH (oct4-reh
 earsal.gpx)\, 20.1 mi\, ~1\,750 ft. Lap 1 easy HR 125–145: loop CLOCKWIS
 E (backwards). 60 s stop at the car. Lap 2 race effort with the race-day H
 R bands mile by mile: climbs 156–165\, rollers 156–163\, descents 148
 –158 (7:35–7:50): loop COUNTER-CLOCKWISE (as published) — 2-mi climb
  off the stop\, miles 9–10 descent at capped pace\, matches the Canyonla
 nds finish. Rocket X Trail\, race kit\, race fuel 60–90 g/hr\, one flask fr
 om the start. Run a −5% descent at 6:40–7:00 on purpose.
END:VEVENT
