BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6e80e1ac-797b-5666-ad40-e86aadf1a236@canyonlands2026
DTSTAMP:20260922T203638Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20261011T071500
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20261011T101500
SUMMARY:LAST LONG RUN — Boreas Pass Road 16.5 mi\, 6 at race effort on th
 e climb
DESCRIPTION:Boreas Pass Road from Breckenridge\, out-and-back\, 16.5 mi\, 9
 \,710 to 11\,478 ft\, 1\,784 ft\, dirt road (mi 1–2 at 6%\, mi 3–8 a s
 teady 3%). 2 easy (HR 130–150) / 60 s stop (flask\, gel) / 6 at race eff
 ort up the 3% to the pass / 7 easy down (140–155\, pace above 7:45\, pro
 tect the quads) / 1.3 easy on the 8% pitch. Block mi 1 restart 156–165\;
  mi 2–6 at 156–163\, hold 160 (= Oasis to The Pit). At 10–11.5k ft e
 xpect 9:00–10:30 on the climb. Pit check = pace per beat block mi 2 vs m
 i 6 within 3%. Race-day test: caffeine 200 mg 45–60 min pre\, famotidine
  20 mg night before + breakfast\, race breakfast\, race gels\, Rocket X Trail
 \, Tums in the pocket. 10–25 F and wind at the pass: gloves\, hat\, shel
 l\, gels against the body. Nothing new after today.
END:VEVENT
