BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:49443454-12bf-530f-8f99-c14c67768fe0@canyonlands2026
DTSTAMP:20260922T203638Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20261024T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20261024T103000
SUMMARY:RACE — Canyonlands Ultra Marathon — 3:20
DESCRIPTION:7 AM start. Skip Buttes. Mile 2 at 9:25\, let the field go. Mil
 es 10–11 at 7:03 / 6:38. The Pit ~57:30\, Oasis ~2:04:50\, The Pit ~2:44
 :00\, 60 s each. HR bands (threshold 175): mi 0–5 sit 152–158 (ceiling
  162)\; mi 5–16 156–163 (166\, 168 briefly on climbs)\; mi 16–21 158
 –165 (168)\; descents 148–153\; whole-race avg 158–162. The Pit 21.2
  = determination line: GO if on pace at ≤162 on mi 18–20\, no quad gra
 b\, mile-19 gel down\, cadence 173+ → 165–175 to the line (178 on the 
 mile 22 climb). HOLD → 158–163. Gels at 9\, 14\, 19\, 23. Oasis decisi
 on: on plan → run it\; >2 min back → 8:00–8:15 home\, HR ≤158. Adi
 os Pro 4.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
